<title>USA: NGC Corp issues $175 mln in debentures.</title>
<headline>NGC Corp issues $175 mln in debentures.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following debt issue was priced on Thursday, said lead manager Lehman Brothers.</p>
<p>BORROWER NGC CORP</p>
<p>AMT $175 MLN	 COUPON 7.625 PCT  MATURITY 10/15/2026</p>
<p>TYPE DEBENTURES    ISS PRICE 99.522  PAY DATE 04/15/1997</p>
<p>LAST MOODY BAA1    SPREAD +78 BP     PAY FREQ SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P BBB-PLUS  YIELD 7.666 PCT   CALLABLE NO</p>
<p>UNDERLYING: OLD 30-YEAR TREASURY BOND</p>
<p>-- Corporate bond unit 212-859-1678</p>
</text>
